# Local QA artifacts (sweep screenshots/results, test logs, ad-hoc probes).
# `qa-evidence/*`, not `qa-evidence/`: excluding the directory itself also excludes
# everything below it and git cannot re-include a file under an excluded directory —
# which is why the two negations below had never worked and no receipt was ever
# committable (found 2026-10-18 when the first receipt was staged).
qa-evidence/*
# …except the committed verification receipts (see CONTRIBUTING.md)
!qa-evidence/receipts/
!qa-evidence/receipts/**

# Quality-tool outputs (knip/jscpd)
jscpd-report/
